sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Candidate as Candidate
    participant Voice as Voice Channel
    participant STT as Speech-to-Text Pipeline
    participant Normalizer as Transcript Normalizer
    participant Router as API / Backend (/api/v1)
    participant DB as SQLite3 Database

    Voice->>Candidate: Plays Question (Speaker: AI)
    Candidate->>Voice: Speaks Answer (Audio Stream)
    Voice->>STT: Raw Audio Data
    STT->>Normalizer: Raw Transcription + Timestamps
    Normalizer->>Router: POST /screening/sessions/{id}/segments
    Router->>DB: INSERT transcript_segments (seq_num, text, confidence)
    Router->>DB: INSERT screening_interactions (question_id, candidate_answer)
    Router-->>Normalizer: 201 Created (Segments Persisted)

